<title>USA: Egypt seeks 165,000 T U.S./Australian wheat -trade.</title>
<headline>Egypt seeks 165,000 T U.S./Australian wheat -trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt will tender Wednesday night for a total of 165,000 tonnes of U.S. or Australian wheat in a private tender, several U.S. exporters said.  </p>
<p>&quot;They (Egypt) need prices tonight,&quot; one U.S. exporter said.</p>
<p>The wheat would be divided into three positions of 55,000 tonnes each. One lot was slated for April 1-10 delivery, the second for May 1-10 and the third for June 1-7, several U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>But one exporter said the third position was set for June 1-10. No other details were given.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
